# Lore AMI Build Guide

Generated by `fabrica lore ami build` for Lore **{{ .Version }}** in `{{ .Region }}`.

## Overview

`fabrica lore create` requires a pre-baked AMI containing:

| Component   | Version  | systemd unit     |
|-------------|----------|------------------|
| Ubuntu      | 22.04 LTS| —                |
| loreserver  | {{ .Version }}  | `loreserver`     |
| SSM Agent   | latest   | `amazon-ssm-agent` |

Fabrica's cloud-init only configures the store (local EBS or S3) and starts the service — it does not install software.

## Generated Files

- `image-builder-recipe.json` — AWS EC2 Image Builder recipe (input to `aws imagebuilder create-image-recipe`)
- `component.yaml` — Image Builder Component document (input to `aws imagebuilder create-component`)
{{- if .IncludePacker }}
- `packer.pkr.hcl` — Packer HCL template (use with `packer init` + `packer build`)
{{- end }}
- `build-guide.md` — this file

