## Path B — Packer (alternative)

Packer drives a builder EC2 instance directly without the Image Builder service.

### 1. Prepare the loreserver binary

Build or obtain the `loreserver` binary and place it in a local directory:

```bash
# Example: /tmp/lore-bin/loreserver
```

### 2. Initialize and validate

```bash
packer init packer.pkr.hcl
packer fmt -check packer.pkr.hcl
packer validate packer.pkr.hcl
```

### 3. Build the AMI

```bash
packer build -var "lore_source_dir=/tmp/lore-bin" packer.pkr.hcl
```

Packer prints the new AMI ID at the end. Update `fabrica.yaml`:

```yaml
lore:
  amiId: ami-<id>
```

